                <li> Shri V L Kantha Rao, IAS, Secretary, Ministry of Mines, Govt. of India, visited the Corporate Office of Hindustan Copper Limited in Kolkata on 08.11.2023 to review the activities of the Company. Functional Directors of HCL joint Secretary (Mines) in the valedictory function of 10th International Mining, Equipment & Minerals Exhibition (IME) held at Eco Park, Kolkata.</li>
